// Single-ally heal, same `BasicAura`+`Regeneration` shape as
// prayer_of_healing.ron (that file's own header documents why: no
// lump-sum instant-heal primitive exists, only a per-second tick, so a
// short strong burst approximates an instant heal). Sheet's condition-
// cleanse rider dropped, no condition-removal `BuffEffect` exists.
//
// Reviewer correction: `BasicAura(targets: InGroup)` hits every ally in
// range, no single-target cap exists -- `range` is the only real lever
// for "single-ally" framing. Original `range: 18.0` copied mass_heal.ron's
// own group-heal range verbatim (3x wider than the actual group heal
// mass_cure_wounds.ron's 6.0), making this spell a cheaper, wider group
// heal that undercut mass_cure_wounds entirely. Narrowed to a tight
// touch-range, matching word_of_full_restoration.ron's own correctly-
// scoped single-ally range.
BasicAura(
    buildup_duration: 0.5,
    cast_duration: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.35,
    targets: InGroup,
    auras: [
        (
            kind: Regeneration,
            strength: 24.0,
            duration: Some(3.0),
            category: Some(Magical),
        ),
    ],
    aura_duration: Some(3.0),
    range: 3.0,
    energy_cost: 150.0,
    scales_with_combo: false,
    specifier: None,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Evocation),
        source: Some(Divine),
        cooldown: Some(20.0),
        // level 6 spell -> min_level 36, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(36)),
    ),
)
